      "node_type": "class",
      "name": "CircuitBreaker",
      "line_number": 45,
      "docstring": "Batch-level circuit breaker.\n\nBehavior:\n    \u2022 record_success(): resets failure count\n    \u2022 record_failure(): increments failure count\n    \u2022 check(): raises CircuitBreakerOpenError if breaker is \"open\"\n\nTrigger:\n    - When failures >= failure_threshold\n\nThis is NOT part of the agentic runtime (L1\u2013L5).\nIt is META-only resilience infrastructure.",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "class",
      "name": "CircuitBreakerOpenError",
      "line_number": 81,
      "docstring": "Raised when the batch-level circuit breaker is open.",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [
        "RuntimeError"
      ],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "node_type": "class",
      "name": "BatchFeedbackAggregator",
      "line_number": 91,
      "docstring": "Aggregates results across a batch.\n\nFields:\n    \u2022 results: list of successful workflow outputs\n    \u2022 failed:  # of jobs that raised exceptions at batch level\n    \u2022 breaker_open: True if breaker opened during processing\n\nDerived properties:\n    \u2022 total_jobs: results + failed\n    \u2022 successful: len(results)",
      "imports": [],
      "dependencies": [],
      "responsibility_level": "L5",
      "children": []
